{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "36eb82de-b201-5c46-b833-9b2a81a3e56e", "source_ordinal": 2773, "reading_ordinal": 1280, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "应然人生", "published_at": "2022-05-31T00:22:45+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/33416764/answer/2508659518"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题非常好回答——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你觉得你这一代的普通人的人生，和你父母那一代的普通人的人生一样吗？", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你用过粮票布票油票吗？用过手摇电话吗？收过电报吗？补过钢精锅吗？吃过铝饭盒吗？听过英模报告会吗？见过苏联解体吗？开过十一届三中全会吗？经历过下岗再就业大潮吗？看过911直播吗？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你父母的这一代的普通人，和ta们父母的那一代的普通人的人生一样吗？", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta们见过饿死人吗？见过大串联吗？挣过工分吗？去北大荒开过拖拉机吗？去云南修过地球吗？见过大炼钢铁吗？当过民兵吗？挖过战备工事吗？", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们父母的父母这一代的普通人，和ta们的父母那一代的普通人的人生一样吗？", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们见过日军入城吗？躲过国民党抓壮丁吗？进山躲过扫荡吗？见过解放军沿街露宿吗？挤在收音机前听过开国大典吗？去过朝鲜吗？去过奠边府吗？", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你get到这个point没有？", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "询问“普通人应有的一生”，本质上就是在要求预测历史。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "也许在1839年之前，这问题可以有一个不算太错的答案。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是自从1840年以后，相信所谓“普通人应有的一生”的人，恐怕踏了个空的有九成九。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "自己回顾过去十年，十年前你料到今天你会在你现在所在的地方、面对你现在面对的这件事吗？", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一切“普通人的一生”，都逻辑必然的是马后炮。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "什么“普通人的一生”？", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "F*ck common.", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 548}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：普通人的一生应该是怎样的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“应然人生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题非常好回答——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题非常好回答——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f5d0bccd-ddba-5d4b-854b-4983069839f6", "source_ordinal": 2772, "reading_ordinal": 1281, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "裁员过渡", "published_at": "2022-06-01T05:46:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/529162822/answer/2510176375"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一般来说，被裁员后做以下几种处理：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）立刻开始搜集情报。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一方面，你可以通过和亲戚朋友、前同事、老同学、前客户……等等业内人士聚餐聊天来了解ta们所知道的情况，请教ta们的建议。这些人搞不好会有某种提议，但你也不要一口就答应。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "除非你是没钱过生活，否则你并不应该直接接受你能拿到的第一个offer，而应该在把该拜访完的人都拜访完，该摸底的岗位都摸底完之后再综合决定。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在这方面情况摸得差不多之后，你要尽快开始找工作，直接与就业市场接触。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "关于这个找工作面试本身的战略战术另说，要点在于要开始找，周期性的保持寻找。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "找的时候做好准备——被拒绝是正常的，你的目的也不是立刻就成功，而是和就业市场保持接触，定期在真实市场里了解岗位需求，和意向企业的人事招聘人员建立联系，为后续的求职创造越来越有利的条件。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你其实首先要的是招聘人员的反馈，有了这些反馈，你才好针对性的自我发展，而不是完全闭门造车，在家独练神功。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "2）根据自己拿到的综合情报，进行总体的思考，决定自己下一步的计划。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这一般都是一个“我需要花多少时间用什么方式去增强哪一方面，准备什么条件“的决定。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你这个计划来自某些人的忠告和情报，你的计划也最好和这些人进行验证和讨论，得到ta们的检验和进一步建议，确保这是一个有外部认可的意见，而不完全是你自己臆想出来的乐观。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这些人——其中有一些可能是HR或者在职的专家——既然一开始就给了你情报，还参与了你的计划制定，ta们当然会对计划良好实施的结果有期待和信心，同时成为你的计划的隐形“投资人”。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你积极的实施这个计划，按部就班的学习或者依计划进行下一步的筹备，这本身就能获得ta们的认可，ta们自然而然会越来越倾向于投入更多ta们自己的资源来帮你入职甚至创业。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "即使ta们自己本人没有这些资源，但是ta们作为业内人士，提出的有代表性的需求也会是有普遍意义的。你按照这个综合情报做出的努力也会有最大的概率帮你重新上路。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而这个修行增强的阶段，大可以看作一段休养期，规律饮食、积极进取，亦不失为一个好的人生喘息。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人们之所以常在这个阶段难以坚持，渐至于堕落沉沦、不知所以，一大原因是计划并无根据，只是受自己的恐惧驱使，假托了一个“思考”的虚应故事而胡作非为而已。久而没有成效，就被挫折感和恐惧感淹没，固结而成抑郁了。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 958}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以这个“依情据实”至关重要。", "char_start": 959, "char_end": 974}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "3）要避免仓促短期解决，要尽可能的寻找可以长期从事的事业。", "char_start": 975, "char_end": 1004}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "起点不怕低，要害在于这要是一个有延续性、有前途、与人生计划兼容、通向最终退休的职业计划的一部分，尽量不要“病急乱投医”。", "char_start": 1005, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "否则可能只是青春换钱，并不值得。", "char_start": 1066, "char_end": 1082}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：2022 年被裁员今天突然接到公司的电话，说要裁员了。我一整晚都没睡。太突然，不知道该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“裁员过渡”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一般来说，被裁员后做以下几种处理：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一般来说，被裁员后做以下几种处理：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9504036d-d94f-5ae7-8066-a181cdb6d93e", "source_ordinal": 2771, "reading_ordinal": 1282, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "军事同盟", "published_at": "2022-06-01T13:31:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/23982873/answer/2510649091"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“组成军事同盟”的意义并不在于“军事互助”，而是B有求于A，于是以其他条件换取A的庇护。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个其他条件往往是某种主权上的妥协。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你受攻击我之所以要出兵，是因为你的主权直接就有我一份。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我受攻击你之所以要出兵，是因为你若不出兵我回头就会惩戒你（或者不直接惩戒，只是借你的敌人之手让你吃吃苦头，等你求救时提出进一步屈辱的要求），你甭想跑掉。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "类似明朝之于朝鲜、美国之于日本。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这才是可以有效运作的军事盟约的本质，也是盟主愿意接受新成员的原则奥妙所在。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "换句话说，这实际上是建立一种宗藩关系。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这也是为什么中印要发起和主导“不结盟运动”。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所谓“不结盟”，就是誓不为奴，也不求为奴隶主。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这也是为什么中国现在一贯主张“加入军事联盟不是寻求国家安全的正道”，声明不加入也不成立针对任何敌人的军事同盟。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "对等实体要军事互助，只要有诚意，完全可以做到任何有同盟国家所能做到的一切合作，没有同盟关系也什么都不耽误。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而一旦要结盟，要承担强制军事义务，就一定要分出个高下主从来。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那么是俄罗斯要奉中国为宗，还是中国要奉俄罗斯为宗呢？", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "若是不能，军事盟约根本无从谈起。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 475}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中俄目前高度互信，但隐藏的矛盾有哪些；结成军事同盟会是明智的吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“军事同盟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““组成军事同盟”的意义并不在于“军事互助”，而是B有求于A，于是以其他条件换取A的庇护。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“组成军事同盟”的意义并不在于“军事互助”，而是B有求于A，于是以其他条件换取A的庇护。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "614df40a-0cae-5b44-b68e-324559dfc2c0", "source_ordinal": 2770, "reading_ordinal": 1283, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "别时礼", "published_at": "2022-06-01T22:40:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/373615534/answer/2511312536"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "每一个已知必死的人，能留给所有所爱之人的最好的礼物，就是自己与死亡的和解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不欢迎死亡，不迷恋死亡，不崇拜死亡。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不厌恶死亡，不回避死亡，不恐惧死亡。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "和死神平辈论交，烹茶下棋，闲话家常。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "自己认识这位朋友，再介绍给家里人认识。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "通过自己的示范和努力，消除自己所爱之人对死亡的欢迎、迷恋、崇拜和厌恶、回避、恐惧。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "当生则尽力生，当死即从容死。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "示范这个健康的态度，成为一个家人朋友内心觉得可以效仿的例子，让ta们对死亡有一个健康、坦率、平和的态度，才是一个将死之人可以给予一切所爱之人的最大礼物。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这件礼物才是宝珠，其他的一切，无论是万贯家财还是谆谆教诲，都只是装珠子的盒子罢了。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 290}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我是一个34岁的妈妈，癌症晚期，可以给5岁的女儿留下些什么有意义的东西?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“别时礼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“每一个已知必死的人，能留给所有所爱之人的最好的礼物，就是自己与死亡的和解。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "每一个已知必死的人，能留给所有所爱之人的最好的礼物，就是自己与死亡的和解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d487bc28-9e79-5b7b-8dd9-c62640cf0214", "source_ordinal": 2769, "reading_ordinal": 1284, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自下人一等", "published_at": "2022-06-03T01:25:33+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/443354148/answer/2512755815"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实我很奇怪，说这些话的人到底是要什么。到底是要得到良好的有希望的恋爱关系，还是要得到“不是我的问题”的麻醉剂。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "论起“会被性魅力轻易迷惑忽略人的品质价值”，年轻男性岂不是比年轻女性严重十倍、百倍？", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "女孩子还是很会情人眼里出潘安的，其概率要比小男生大得多了。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "什么“只喜欢高的帅的”，这基本是瞎扯淡——恰恰是在美女堆里，“长得非常帅”其实是负分。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为女性嘴里说的男性所谓的“帅”，其实不过是长相平均、五官端正、身材正常、无病态而且有审美水准而已。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "换句话来说，80%的90、00后男性只要没什么特别神奇的生理问题，完全可以靠个人努力做到一个帅字。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "胖了你可以减肥，还少花点吃饭钱；", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "牙黄手焦，你可以戒烟，还少花烟钱；", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "瘦了你可以锻炼，徒手锻炼不需要什么条件；", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "发型不行——女性对男性的发型要求之低，低到你可以自己买个推子自己在家推；", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "皮肤不好你可以护肤，难道你穷到大宝都买不起？", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "身型不挺拔你可以自己注意纠正，昂首挺胸需要什么成本？", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "至于说衣着体面，中国是世界第一服装大国，衣服比洗碗布还便宜。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "下面这是同一个人：", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "A", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "B", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "A就是绝对路人，大概也是这个问题下很多人的自我认知。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "B则已经超过了帅的标准线。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你不打扮不比A差，你有什么理由收拾起来比B差很远？", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这真的是“长得不帅”的问题吗？", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "自认为不输于A，而在女性眼里得不到和B相近的评价，请问合理的理由是什么？", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "由A到B，哪方面的成本超过了你的能力范围？", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "是衣服，还是洗面奶润肤霜，还是发型，还是笑容？", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你不如ta的合理理由是什么？", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "什么叫自下人一等？", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "说起来也许你们难以置信，但实际上绝大部分的丑陋，其根源是令人不寒而栗的自恋和傲慢。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 698}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 699, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为ta根本不是没有努力的空间，而是基于一种“我已经尽了全部可能的努力”的心态，心安理得的蹲守在自己的安乐窝里。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "ta无意识的把“可能尽的一切努力”缩小到了“我乐意尽的一切努力”的红线内。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "我不乐意，就不可能。", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "是这一点真正妨碍了ta们帅起来。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "其实ta们可以减肥，只是减肥所需要的忍耐和付出已经进入ta们不乐意的范围内了，所以被盖上了“不可能“的大红章了。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "ta们的解决方案是两条——", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 897}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "第一条，指望世界降低“帅”的标准，低到ta们所乐意付出的限度以下。", "char_start": 898, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这个限度其实非常低，不然ta们也不会认定别人帅都都是天生的——因为天生的意味着什么力气也不需要用，像ta们一样。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "第二条，直接贬斥异性对这些标准的执着——认为对方想要“帅”这个外在条件是不合理的，或者鼓吹对方就是想要钱来补足丑陋，把问题转化为自己没钱。", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "总而言之，一切都围着“首先，我没错”这个前提出发，是全世界有罪、全世界有错、整个女性群体有劣根性。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1108}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "而“我”也绝对不可能在大义名分上有半点亏欠。", "char_start": 1109, "char_end": 1131}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "说句实话，你帅不帅、有钱没钱，根本就不重要。", "char_start": 1133, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你这份日破天的自恋才是别人对你退避三舍的根本原因。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "丑陋和贫穷（准确的说是“对你将来会一直贫穷的强烈预判”）只是这份心理残疾的最直观的外显而已——就和红肿是发炎的诊断特征一样。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1244}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "A还是B，你自己选。", "char_start": 1245, "char_end": 1255}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "少找借口。", "char_start": 1256, "char_end": 1261}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-06/02/144b7c40b42ce6b20b43d1e1f174ed20.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-06/02/0ebae224461a42cb99342c83978c4798.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-06/02/a432201a74e24fa5fdc6cca581d4bc3c.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48, "image": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有人说：“我羡慕那些又高又帅的男生，他们拥有过很多女孩子的青春，可我却只能拼命地赚钱。”你怎么看？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“自下人一等”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实我很奇怪，说这些话的人到底是要什么。到底是要得到良好的有希望的恋爱关系，还是要得到“不是我的问题”的麻醉剂。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实我很奇怪，说这些话的人到底是要什么。到底是要得到良好的有希望的恋爱关系，还是要得到“不是我的问题”的麻醉剂。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "71a83d91-454d-53e9-8c09-84475d2471c8", "source_ordinal": 2768, "reading_ordinal": 1285, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "从无到有", "published_at": "2022-06-03T02:49:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/535674989/answer/2512784718"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是一种技巧，你们可以仔细体会一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么技巧呢？", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "就是在两个看似截然不同、不可兼容的、间不容发的状态之间，架一座中间态的桥。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这往往是处理棘手事务的最富智慧的对策之一。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "何谓封？纹丝不动谓之封。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "何谓不封？任意行动谓之不封。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "从完全封闭到完全不封闭之间，设置一个指标——进入公共场所所需要的核酸检测级别。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "允许户内和方舱内活动为0级开放，允许进入其他闭环区域为1级，允许使用公共道路为2级，允许进入公共聚集场所为3级，允许使用市内公共交通为4级，允许使用跨地区交通为5级。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "核酸检测间隔则分为0级当场检测、1级24小时、2级48小时、3级72小时、4级五天、5级七天、6级十五天、7级不定期、8级不检。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果我们把前者称为封闭等级，后者称为检疫等级，那么：", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你会发现所谓的封闭，就是0-5级开放均要求0级检测，", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而所谓的完全开放，就是 0-5级开放均要求8级检（即无需检测）。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "毫无疑问，即使保持“高级别开放必须执行不低于低级别的核酸检测标准”的原则，你也能发现在完全封闭和完全不封闭之间出现了非常多的中间态。", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "例如（开放级别-检疫级别）：", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "0-8 / 1-8 / 2-7 / 3-6 / 4-3 / 5-2，定义了一个封闭级别A，", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "0-7 / 1-7 / 2-6 / 3-4 / 4-2 / 5-1，则定义了一个比A更接近封闭的级别B。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这样，就把一个如同电灯开关一样非黑即白而黑白皆错的问题，变成了一个包含大量调节空间、以至于可精确调整以寻求成本效益的最佳组合的问题。", "char_start": 574, "char_end": 640}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果你把完全无检测的自由流动称为解封度为100%的解封，那么上海现在的解封大概只有15%左右。", "char_start": 641, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果这算“突然”，那么大概也可以说“蜗牛突然移动了一毫米”。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不只是防疫，", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "在理想与现实之间、", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "在辞职与不辞职之间、", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "在战争与和平之间、", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "在统治和被统治之间、", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "在忠诚与不忠诚之间、", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在分手和继续之间……", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "到处存在着这样的空间。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "人生是在这些空间里的游刃有余，而不是在南北两极之间的来回跳跃。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "当你觉得“面前只有两个选择”，你要非常仔细的思考是不是真的没有中间状态存在。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "如果你发生误判，很大的概率你是在两条死路中选一个看上去不那么不体面的死法而已。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 913}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：上海解封是不是太突然了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“从无到有”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是一种技巧，你们可以仔细体会一下。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是一种技巧，你们可以仔细体会一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c42eaa53-b800-554e-9b8c-ebda044cd094", "source_ordinal": 2767, "reading_ordinal": 1286, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "紧急呼救", "published_at": "2022-06-04T01:35:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/535919601/answer/2513831837"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "责任问题归法院判决，作为个人你要解决的是现实安全问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "阅读以下链接，做好设置，最好练习一下。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在 iPhone 上使用“SOS 紧急联络”功能\n使用 Apple Watch 上的“SOS 紧急联络”功能\n使用 Apple Watch 上的“摔倒检测”\n在紧急情况下使用安卓手机获得帮助\n使用紧急求助和呼叫 | 华为官网\n教爸妈用手机 | 巧用紧急求助功能，给爸妈多一分守护\n使用跌倒检测发起SOS紧急求助 | 华为官网", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 210}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 48, "sample": "在 iPhone 上使用“SOS 紧急联络”功能\n使用 Apple Watch 上的“SOS 紧急联络”功能\n使用 Apple Watch 上的“摔倒检测”\n在"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：河南一大学生脑出血去世，曾求救120未果，谁该为此事负主要责任？还有哪些细节值得注意？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003"], "summary": "围绕“紧急呼救”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“责任问题归法院判决，作为个人你要解决的是现实安全问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "责任问题归法院判决，作为个人你要解决的是现实安全问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "72a308cb-ab83-5660-8990-e6c7a0a06f36", "source_ordinal": 2766, "reading_ordinal": 1287, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "砸采样点", "published_at": "2022-06-04T12:40:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/535920607/answer/2514219245"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "后续如何？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "后续首先征信受损，想贷款的话会有麻烦。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果是什么正规企事业单位，估计还有可能丢工作或者职业发展受阻——正值裁员高峰，合理理由送上门。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个焦虑失控的心理状态，后续可能还要看精神科和心理医生。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "谈着恋爱后续可能要分手。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "结着婚后续可能不离婚，但是也少不得有一番风波。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一群看客只顾着借人发泄自己的情绪，哪里真的在意这人“后续”如何？", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换了是你，当你泛起这种冲动的时候，千万不要以为干完了这种事你只会收获“广泛的掌声”。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "给你“鼓掌”的这些人其实连你姓什么、叫什么都没有兴趣知道。你的下场会如何，对ta们属于多余的信息。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不信你看看——“鼓掌”的何其多，但有几个在问的？", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "社会运行规则的改变总是这样。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "总是有大批跟不上时代的遗老遗少停留在过去怨恨哭喊、心怀不满、寻求“发泄”。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "总是会有适应不及的人或无意或有意的踩中原来并不存在的新设红线，被新的红线“无情”地处理和惩罚。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "有时这个过程要持续两三代人——比如禁止醉驾，如此简单直白的现代规则，到现在也还是一样不断此起彼伏的被人“以身证道”。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "从“凭什么吐痰要罚钱”，到“凭什么高压线下不准钓鱼”，到“凭什么不能闯红灯”，“凭什么不让喝酒开车”，再到“凭什么进门要核酸码”，其实都是一个规律。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "总是有人会“我觉得没必要”，然后会有人蠢到踩红线，踩了红线总有一群“廉价同志”“鼓掌叫好”、抓住一切机会蒙面混在人群里给新红线喝倒彩，以为“反抗”。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "折腾好久，最后还是会接受。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "到最后，那些不断替ta们闯红线的“英雄”人物付出最大的代价，然后被时代遗忘得一干二净。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 659}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这些人自己习惯了之后——尽管其过程充满毫无意义的心理挣扎和精神成本——也把自己当初鼓的掌忘得一干二净。", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "最后这两类人付出的成本都是自己买单，纯粹净损失。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "有人可能要问——难道人不能有点反抗精神？", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那么，你问过自己这个问题吗？", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 774}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "——什么是反抗精神？", "char_start": 775, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "难道是指凡是你不爽、你不认同的事情你就要有勇气去打击？", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "何以见得你不爽的、你不认同的就一定是错误的？", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "万一它不是错误的呢？", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 847}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0204"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待网传「上海普陀区一核酸采样点被砸」，涉事男子因寻衅滋事已被行政处罚，事件后续情况如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“砸采样点”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“后续如何？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "后续如何？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
